181 - Does Jesus Care?
 / 
Key: C
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 181
Topic: Jesus Christ - 

Verse 1:
[C]Does Jesus care [F]when my [C]heart is pained Too [G]deeply for mirth or [C]song,
[C]As the burdens press, and the [F]cares distress And the [C]way grows [G]weary and [C]long?
[C]Oh [G7]yes, He cares, I [C]know He cares, His [G]heart is [D7]touched with my [G]grief;
[G7]When [C]the days are weary, the [F]long nights dreary, I [C]know my [G]Savior [C]cares.

Refrain:
[C]O [F]yes, He [C]cares- [G]I know [C]He cares!
[C]His [F]heart [C]is touched [G]with [C]my grief;
[C][G7]When [C]the [G]days [D7]are [G]weary,
[G7][C]The [F]long [C][G]nights [C]dreary,
