Verse 2:
[C]Does [F]Jesus care [C]when [G]my way [C]is dark
[C]With [F]a [C]nameless [G]dread [C]and fear?
[C]As [G7]the [C]daylight fades [G]into [D7]deep [G]night shades,
[G7]Does [C]He [F]care [C]enough [G]to [C]be near?

Verse 3:
[C]Does [F]Jesus [C]care when [G]I've [C]said goodbye
[C]To [F]the [C]dearest on [G]earth [C]to me,
[C]And [G7]my sad [C]heart aches [G]till [D7]it nearly [G]breaks '
[G7]Is [C]it [F]aught to [C]Him? [G]Does [C]He see?
